 &lt;b&gt;TL;DR:&lt;/b&gt;
 &lt;br /&gt;Came back from vacation,
started working on the neck but realised I really needed more tools.
Luckily,
I could get some that weren&amp;rsquo;t too expensive.&lt;/blockquote&gt;


