otherwise I&amp;rsquo;d still be working on the head in December.&lt;/p&gt;</description><media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://poolp.org/posts/2023-07-26/building-my-own-guitar-part-4/feature.jpg"/></item><item><title>Building my own guitar, part 3</title><link>https://poolp.org/posts/2023-07-04/building-my-own-guitar-part-3/</link><pubDate>Tue, 04 Jul 2023 12:31:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://poolp.org/posts/2023-07-04/building-my-own-guitar-part-3/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
